umrounds^{ rac{2}{3}})$.

Let $\parameter$ be $\sparsityk$-sparse, $\Vert\parameter\Vert_0 \leq \sparsityk$ in the sparse linear bandits framework of Theorem~ef{th:regret}. ... Then Algorithm 	exttt{BSLB} with exploration period $
umroundsexplore = \orderof(\sparsityk^{ rac{2}{3}}
umrounds^{ rac{2}{3}})$, achieves a regret guarantee of $\expectedregret = \orderof((\mineigvalue^* )^{-1}\sparsityk^{ rac{2}{3}} 
umrounds^{ rac{2}{3}}).$
